                            <h2 class="nwe-toke-txt-4 mb-3 text-center" data-aos="fade-up">
                                What are <span class="curve-text">Game QA & Testing</span> Services?
                            </h2>
                            <p class="nw-w-txt-2 text-center mb-3" data-aos="fade-up" style="color: #0000008f;">
                                Game QA services are the structured process of testing a game's functionality by
                                identifying defects, regressions, and compliance failures. Video game quality assurance
                                outsourcing covers the full range of testing disciplines a game requires. PlayStation
                                TRC, Xbox TCR, Nintendo Switch LotCheck, and App Store and Google Play review
                                guidelines, and specialized testing covering localization and performance.
                            </p>
                            <p class="nw-w-txt-2 text-center mb-3" data-aos="fade-up" style="color: #0000008f;">
                                As a dedicated game testing company, Clarisco integrates QA into production from early
                                sprint cycles rather than engaging at the end of development when every finding is both
                                expensive and schedule-threatening. Every defect is tracked in your bug management
                                system, prioritized by severity and reproduction rate, and validated and closed in the
                                same sprint where possible.
                            </p>

                            <div class="d-flex justify-content-center gap-2" data-aos="fade-up">
                                <a href="https://api.whatsapp.com/send?phone=919442430551&text=*Hi%20there!%20I%20am%20looking%20for%20your%20Services,%20Shall%20we%20Start%20the%20discussion*"
